Reason:
The bug occurs because the code does not differentiate between an error due to an already attached group and an error due to an incompatible group. In both cases, it jumps to `unlock_exit`, which leads to the potential release of memory for `tcegrp` that may have been allocated but not properly initialized or used, resulting in double freeing or memory leaks.

